@startuml
title Proposed two-layer ARM64 experimental deployment

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E
skinparam packageBorderColor #34495E
skinparam packageFontStyle bold

legend right
  |= Colour |= Meaning |
  |<#D5F5E3> Green | Built or executed evidence exists |
  |<#FCF3CF> Yellow | Versioned artefact/configuration exists; live deployment pending |
  |<#EAECEE> Grey | External or planned infrastructure |
endlegend

folder "Common versioned repository" as Repo #D5F5E3 {
  artifact "kas manifest and\nYocto metadata" as Kas #D5F5E3
  artifact "CONTRACTS v1.1, schemas\nand thing descriptions" as Contracts #D5F5E3
  artifact "Compose, controller, simulator\nand experiment harness" as ServiceArtefacts #D5F5E3
}

package "Layer A - Yocto/QEMU functional platform\nPROVISIONED - GATE G1 ACCEPTED 2026-08-14 (FUNCTIONAL SCOPE ONLY)" as LAYERA #D5F5E3 {
  node "WSL2 Ubuntu 24.04 build host" as BuildHost #D5F5E3 {
    component "kas + BitBake" as Bitbake #D5F5E3
    artifact "egw-image\nsystemd + network + OCI runtime" as Image #D5F5E3
  }
  node "QEMU qemuarm64" as Qemu #D5F5E3 {
    component "Boot checks and\nOCI smoke container" as BootChecks #D5F5E3
  }
}

package "Layer B - native-ARM64 digital-twin service stack\nPLANNED - MEASUREMENT HOST NOT PROVISIONED" as LAYERB #FCF3CF {
  node "Non-burstable native-ARM64 VM\n4 vCPU, 8 GiB, at least 80 GB" as ArmVm #EAECEE {
    component "Eclipse Mosquitto 2.0.22\nMQTT/TLS :8883" as Mosquitto #FCF3CF
    component "MQTT-to-Ditto controller\nHTTP :8000 loopback" as Controller #FCF3CF
    component "Eclipse Ditto 3.9.4\ngateway, policies, things" as Ditto #FCF3CF
    database "MongoDB 7.0.39" as Mongo #FCF3CF
  }
}

node "Operator/load-generator machine\noutside the measurement VM" as Operator #EAECEE {
  component "egw_simulator\npaper-aligned smartwatch profile\n+ two dissertation extensions" as Simulator #FCF3CF
  component "egw_experiments harness\nraw evidence collection" as Harness #FCF3CF
}

Kas --> Bitbake : pinned inputs
Bitbake --> Image
Image --> Qemu
Qemu --> BootChecks

Contracts ..> BootChecks : functional assertions
Contracts ..> Controller : message and twin contract
ServiceArtefacts --> ArmVm : separate deployment

Simulator --> Mosquitto : MQTT/TLS workload
Mosquitto --> Controller
Controller --> Ditto : Ditto HTTP API
Ditto --> Mongo
Harness ..> ArmVm : control and collect\nresource/log artefacts

LAYERA -[hidden]-> LAYERB

note bottom of LAYERA
  Layer A demonstrates build and functional boot properties only.
  It provides no latency, throughput, saturation or resource result.
end note

note bottom of LAYERB
  Layer B is deployed separately; this diagram does not claim that
  Mosquitto, Ditto, MongoDB or the controller run inside egw-image.
  Only a non-burstable native-ARM64 host may support RQ3 results.
end note

note bottom of Operator
  A burstable ARM64 host may support functional integration only.
  QEMU and burstable results are excluded from performance inference.
end note

@enduml
